    "description": {
      "content": "REST API for cloud-based VOD and live video encoding. Supports H.264, H.265/HEVC, VP9, AV1 and more, along with adaptive bitrate packaging (HLS/DASH/Smooth Streaming), DRM (Widevine, PlayReady, FairPlay), and per-title encoding optimisation.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Bitmovin Inc\n Email: support@bitmovin.com",
